WEBVTT

00:02.464 --> 00:04.764
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.904 --> 00:07.924
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.434 --> 00:11.174
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.174 --> 00:15.804
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.244 --> 00:23.204
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.954 --> 00:27.824
Dragon Drive

00:27.824 --> 00:33.314
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.464 --> 00:36.434
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.434 --> 00:39.664
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.174 --> 00:44.544
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.544 --> 00:46.504
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.504 --> 00:52.814
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.554 --> 00:56.924
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.924 --> 01:00.114
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.454 --> 01:05.464
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.464 --> 01:07.024
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.164 --> 01:09.564
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.564 --> 01:12.694
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.104 --> 01:18.174
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.174 --> 01:20.914
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.914 --> 01:28.574
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.734 --> 01:42.964
Where the heck did Chibi go?!

01:47.734 --> 01:49.634
He can't even fight.

01:49.634 --> 01:51.534
I guess we'll just have to use him as feed.

01:51.774 --> 01:53.004
Stop it!

01:55.074 --> 01:56.944
How can you do such a horrible thing?!

01:57.144 --> 02:00.204
This dragon is a toy that we found.

02:24.244 --> 02:27.434
The Anger's End

02:45.764 --> 02:49.254
We sure had a rough time yesterday,
didn't we, Chibi?

02:50.964 --> 02:54.804
This is all your fault for walking around
like a hick with a stupid look on your face.

02:54.804 --> 02:57.204
I didn't have a stupid look on my face.

02:57.204 --> 02:58.504
You sure did!

02:58.504 --> 03:01.774
All slack-jawed, with your mouth
wide open like this.

03:01.774 --> 03:05.044
If you're going to say that,
how about that field trip in kindergarten?

03:05.044 --> 03:07.274
Hey! Don't talk about that!

03:12.084 --> 03:14.244
Hey, we're about to reach the stadium.

03:15.854 --> 03:17.024
That?

03:17.024 --> 03:19.494
That's the stadium
for the Dragonic Heaven?

03:20.134 --> 03:22.364
Wow, that's incredible!

03:22.734 --> 03:25.564
The water running off
from the stadium looks like fog.

03:25.564 --> 03:28.364
It almost looks like an island
floating in the mist.

03:28.774 --> 03:29.874
But, you know...

03:29.874 --> 03:34.414
...if dragons fought in that stadium
wouldn't the whole thing collapse?

03:34.414 --> 03:35.474
You've got it wrong.

03:35.474 --> 03:37.914
The dragons actually fight
somewhere else.

03:37.914 --> 03:42.684
They broadcast the fights in 3-D
for the spectators inside the stadium.

03:42.684 --> 03:44.154
Wow.

03:48.124 --> 03:50.264
Huh? What's that?

03:50.264 --> 03:52.494
There's a pool of water
in that stadium.

04:01.474 --> 04:03.934
Wow! Th-That's incredible!

04:06.004 --> 04:08.104
Well, they're sure getting right into it.

04:19.084 --> 04:22.524
Hasailegger has once again
grabbed onto Kogomosa!

04:22.794 --> 04:25.884
This is a fight
that pits power against power!

04:32.234 --> 04:34.634
Kogomosa has bitten into Hasailegger!

04:34.634 --> 04:36.294
Will this be it?!

04:36.974 --> 04:40.104
Hasailegger is bearing it!
He's bearing Kogomosa's bite attack!

04:40.104 --> 04:41.744
Hasailegger is pinned down!

04:41.744 --> 04:44.644
Kogomosa's teeth are buried into him.

04:48.884 --> 04:50.354
Amazing!

04:50.654 --> 04:52.554
So, they don't actually fight here.

04:52.924 --> 04:56.554
The water surface is like a screen
where holographic images are projected.

04:59.564 --> 05:04.024
Over here we can see Sun Wols,
the champion of the last tournament!

05:04.964 --> 05:08.594
Powerful fighters from every nation
have gathered here for the tournament!

05:09.534 --> 05:15.304
Which team will prove strongest
and win the Dragonic Heaven championship?

05:16.314 --> 05:17.514
Hey!

05:17.514 --> 05:19.944
Don't just stand there, you guys.

05:20.254 --> 05:24.274
Yeah, hurry to the preliminaries stadium,
or time'll be up and you'll be disqualified.

05:24.724 --> 05:26.884
Where's the preliminaries stadium?

05:27.354 --> 05:28.254
Haven't heard about it.

05:28.694 --> 05:30.554
I hope you know the rules.

05:30.824 --> 05:33.264
I told you, I have no idea!

05:33.264 --> 05:34.784
Watch your attitude!

05:35.134 --> 05:37.264
The rules for the preliminaries are easy.

05:37.264 --> 05:39.664
You take a glowing stone from the island.

05:39.964 --> 05:44.104
If a member of the team gets a stone
and hangs onto it before time runs out...

05:44.104 --> 05:45.164
...you pass.

05:45.504 --> 05:47.204
There are fifty glowing stones.

05:47.674 --> 05:49.244
Since there are a hundred teams
starting out...

05:49.244 --> 05:51.834
...this preliminary cuts the number of teams
going to the next level by half.

05:52.044 --> 05:55.484
And what do you have to do
to get these glowing stones?

05:55.754 --> 05:57.724
Each stone emits its own light.

05:58.254 --> 06:00.884
If you aim for the light, you'll find the stone.

06:01.054 --> 06:02.754
That sounds pretty easy.

06:02.754 --> 06:04.194
Let's get going!

06:04.664 --> 06:05.884
Hang on, Reiji.

06:09.964 --> 06:11.904
Here, I want you to take this with you.

06:11.904 --> 06:13.234
It's a lucky amulet.

06:13.234 --> 06:15.224
Right.

06:15.804 --> 06:16.774
Here.

06:16.934 --> 06:17.904
Thanks.

06:17.904 --> 06:20.394
I don't know if it'll work, but...

06:20.814 --> 06:22.364
...do your best, Reiji!

06:22.714 --> 06:23.404
Thanks!

06:36.754 --> 06:37.964
All right!

06:37.964 --> 06:40.154
Let's get it on, Thundervolt!

06:40.494 --> 06:41.924
Let's fly high and proud!

07:06.754 --> 07:08.194
This is really fast!

07:08.194 --> 07:10.154
Just hang on tight, Kanper!

07:13.264 --> 07:14.434
There's the island!

07:14.434 --> 07:15.984
That's where the preliminaries
are taking place?

07:19.604 --> 07:21.864
So, what's the time limit?

07:22.434 --> 07:25.464
It's over when that star
dips below the horizon.

07:28.014 --> 07:29.844
Th-Then, there's no time left at all!

07:31.484 --> 07:33.344
Hey! This is no time to be yawning!

07:33.584 --> 07:36.674
I'm kind of tired, so I'll let you guys
take care of the rest.

07:37.584 --> 07:39.124
What the hell's that?!

07:39.124 --> 07:41.094
You haven't done anything, Rockaku!

07:41.324 --> 07:44.524
Considering that time's running out,
don't you think it would be better if we all...

07:49.794 --> 07:51.464
What're you trying to do, Daisuke?!

07:51.834 --> 07:53.024
I challenge you, Reiji!

07:53.974 --> 07:55.024
What for?

07:55.374 --> 07:57.034
W-What for?!

07:57.374 --> 07:58.604
Yeah, why?

08:01.674 --> 08:05.374
After that lovey-dovey scene,
you still don't get it?!

08:07.214 --> 08:08.084
Listen up!

08:08.084 --> 08:10.714
The challenge is
to get the glowing stone!

08:11.184 --> 08:15.384
If I get the stone,
then I get to take your, uh...

08:15.894 --> 08:18.014
My... what?

08:20.064 --> 08:22.964
I get to take that lucky amulet
that Maiko gave you!

08:26.364 --> 08:27.594
You want this?

08:28.074 --> 08:29.434
Uh, yeah.

08:29.774 --> 08:31.934
I don't mind. Here.

08:33.914 --> 08:35.964
I won't accept it!

08:36.514 --> 08:38.144
I challenge you! I challenge you!

08:38.144 --> 08:40.344
We're going to battle it out and fight for it!

08:40.344 --> 08:42.844
I will not lose against you!

08:43.154 --> 08:44.884
H-Hey, Daisuke!

08:45.454 --> 08:46.614
H-Hey!

08:51.994 --> 08:53.934
What a childish challenge this is.

08:53.934 --> 08:55.794
It makes me embarrassed just to watch!

08:58.064 --> 09:00.594
You want to know
if I'm going to help them?

09:01.004 --> 09:04.264
If the two of them can't handle it here,
then they don't deserve to go on.

09:04.874 --> 09:08.244
How about we just sit this one out
and see how good they are?

09:08.714 --> 09:11.644
Reiji, you'd better hurry
or you'll miss the deadline.

09:11.914 --> 09:13.274
I know that!

09:23.894 --> 09:24.764
Damn!

09:24.764 --> 09:28.094
Does he think I'm not a worthy opponent?

09:28.094 --> 09:30.154
Well, he'd better watch it, because...

09:34.574 --> 09:35.554
There it is!

09:47.554 --> 09:49.014
Take a look at this, Kanper!

09:49.014 --> 09:51.214
There's a whole bunch of them here.

09:53.024 --> 09:54.454
In your face, Reiji!

09:54.754 --> 09:56.744
Even I can do it if I give it a try.

10:03.234 --> 10:04.854
That's the tenth one.

10:05.204 --> 10:07.704
None of them are very worthy, are they?

10:07.704 --> 10:11.864
It's a wonder how they can all fall
into such a simple trap.

10:17.444 --> 10:19.274
Geez, that scared me!

10:19.584 --> 10:21.074
Who did that?!

10:22.714 --> 10:25.184
Oh, my. He managed to dodge it.

10:25.184 --> 10:27.454
To put up an ice barrier as quickly as that.

10:27.454 --> 10:29.614
That's a dragon with good reflexes.

10:29.894 --> 10:31.224
Did you guys do that?!

10:31.224 --> 10:33.194
You could've killed me!

10:33.794 --> 10:36.094
But that's what we intended!

10:36.334 --> 10:37.164
What?

10:37.164 --> 10:41.574
It seems that you are not aware
of the crime you have committed.

10:41.574 --> 10:42.534
Crime?

10:43.004 --> 10:47.314
For the crime of attempting to steal
those rocks that we placed there...

10:47.314 --> 10:50.584
...you certainly will have to be dealt
appropriate punishment.

10:50.584 --> 10:52.244
Placed here?

10:52.244 --> 10:54.304
It doesn't look like it belongs to anyone.

10:54.654 --> 10:57.414
Why would you think
there'd be so many in one location?

11:04.024 --> 11:06.694
There's a little time left before the deadline.

11:06.694 --> 11:10.094
I think we'll enjoy you as our last prey.

11:10.464 --> 11:11.454
What?!

11:12.064 --> 11:16.434
Consider it an honor to die
at the hands of these two dragons.

11:18.144 --> 11:19.634
Stop messing around!

11:19.974 --> 11:23.274
Why can't I get any respect around here?!

11:24.644 --> 11:26.134
You can't escape.

11:26.614 --> 11:27.644
I'm not running away.

11:33.654 --> 11:35.314
Get him, Kashinki.

11:37.154 --> 11:38.024
Kanper!

11:44.634 --> 11:46.234
A little flame like that?

11:46.234 --> 11:48.374
Kanper can freeze it in an instant.

11:48.374 --> 11:49.704
Go! Freeze Wind!

11:59.984 --> 12:02.784
Whoa! A savage battle
is taking place over here!

12:03.384 --> 12:06.554
Appearing for the first time
in this tournament is... uh...

12:06.554 --> 12:08.454
...the fighter is Hagiwara!

12:08.594 --> 12:10.694
Hey! It's Daisuke!

12:10.694 --> 12:12.714
Thank goodness they made it!

12:12.964 --> 12:14.634
Fantastic! Fantastic!

12:14.634 --> 12:17.964
To think he could defeat
two fearsome dragons like that in one shot!

12:18.434 --> 12:19.234
That's right.

12:19.234 --> 12:22.634
You really worked hard
in the training room, after all.

12:25.604 --> 12:27.504
Go for it, Daisuke!

12:28.614 --> 12:30.774
What's the matter? Come and get me.

12:34.184 --> 12:36.084
- This is so good.
- Delicious.

12:37.314 --> 12:39.284
Don't you underestimate me!

12:39.884 --> 12:41.554
Go! Kanper!

12:46.224 --> 12:50.064
Who the heck are these guys?!
Hey! You! Get away!

12:53.004 --> 12:55.064
Oh dear, he got bitten.

12:56.134 --> 12:58.804
That's excellent timing, Sally.

13:00.444 --> 13:01.314
Yes, sir.

13:01.314 --> 13:04.044
Now it's our turn.

13:04.784 --> 13:06.144
En-Ouji!

13:06.144 --> 13:08.584
Smash them to pieces.

13:33.674 --> 13:35.614
No way! He'll hurt his own teammates!

13:52.864 --> 13:54.264
But how?

13:54.264 --> 13:56.094
How could it have revived so quickly?!

13:56.334 --> 14:01.204
You must be punished for thinking
you could fight us with a dragon like that.

14:02.604 --> 14:04.094
Daisuke!

14:13.184 --> 14:15.614
Daisuke, what're you doing on your own?!

14:16.084 --> 14:17.014
Reiji!

14:17.854 --> 14:19.714
The boy from yesterday.

14:20.924 --> 14:22.894
I didn't know you were on the same team.

14:23.394 --> 14:25.014
This could be interesting.

14:25.524 --> 14:27.324
You all right, Daisuke?

14:27.764 --> 14:28.734
Stay away!

14:29.994 --> 14:31.734
I don't want you coming to rescue me!

14:31.734 --> 14:34.164
How are we supposed to settle things then?!

14:34.534 --> 14:35.334
You idiot!

14:35.334 --> 14:38.034
Who cares about settling scores?
This isn't the time!

14:38.504 --> 14:42.374
You might not care about this,
but I'm dead serious!

14:42.774 --> 14:44.714
Don't let your pride get the better of you!

14:44.714 --> 14:46.644
Look at Kanper! He's all beaten up!

14:47.414 --> 14:48.584
Shut up!

14:48.584 --> 14:49.984
I can do it!

14:49.984 --> 14:51.614
I can still do it!

14:52.084 --> 14:53.754
I'm sorry, Kanper.

14:53.754 --> 14:55.854
I know I'm pushing you too hard.

14:55.854 --> 14:57.224
But...

14:57.764 --> 14:59.624
But, I...

15:01.694 --> 15:04.464
Hey, Abe, can I see your homework?

15:05.904 --> 15:08.804
Hey, big bro. I don't get this.
Can you teach me?

15:08.804 --> 15:11.504
Come on. What's the matter with you?
This goes like this, and...

15:12.074 --> 15:15.944
I never put all my energy
into doing something by myself.

15:17.114 --> 15:19.614
I always relied on others to help me
with things I didn't want to deal with.

15:19.614 --> 15:21.254
And other things, I would just abandon.

15:21.254 --> 15:22.914
I figured that was the way to go.

15:24.724 --> 15:25.724
But...

15:25.724 --> 15:27.584
...that's when you...

15:28.494 --> 15:30.184
...when you showed up.

15:31.764 --> 15:33.764
No matter how difficult things got...

15:33.764 --> 15:37.494
...and no matter how many times
you failed, you never gave up.

15:38.764 --> 15:42.254
Not only that, you got even stronger.

15:43.234 --> 15:45.504
When I compared myself to you...

15:45.504 --> 15:48.244
...I couldn't help seeing
that I was the lame one.

15:48.244 --> 15:50.574
I realized how uncool I was.

15:53.844 --> 15:55.714
Kanper, you know what?

15:55.714 --> 15:58.914
I always thought it was kind of uncool
to be so earnest and serious about things.

15:59.554 --> 16:03.044
But you can't get strong
in this game unless you're serious.

16:03.994 --> 16:06.824
If I get serious and push myself to the limit
and get as strong as I can...

16:06.824 --> 16:10.294
...then I can challenge him
to a real match, with no holds barred!

16:10.294 --> 16:12.824
That would be kinda... cool.

16:15.234 --> 16:16.394
That's right.

16:16.674 --> 16:18.974
So if someone lends me a hand now...

16:19.244 --> 16:22.304
...I'll look really bad, really uncool.

16:23.014 --> 16:24.774
Don't you think, Kanper?

16:25.144 --> 16:27.374
We haven't reached our limits yet!

16:28.184 --> 16:30.154
Now, come and get us!

16:30.284 --> 16:31.914
We can still keep going!

16:32.224 --> 16:33.444
Daisuke.

16:34.084 --> 16:35.154
Daisuke!

16:35.154 --> 16:36.024
Shut up!

16:36.024 --> 16:37.764
Don't interfere with this!

16:37.764 --> 16:39.964
I've worked really hard for this!

16:39.964 --> 16:41.984
I can take them on, by myself!

16:44.034 --> 16:47.434
All beaten up but still willing to rise up.

16:47.704 --> 16:51.444
I am so very moved by your
determination and passion.

16:51.444 --> 16:52.534
Sue!

16:53.144 --> 16:58.104
But, brother, we've never faced people
as determined and serious as they are.

16:58.314 --> 17:02.444
I'd really like to fight against them
in a serious battle!

17:03.054 --> 17:06.784
So you mustn't be defeated
at such an early stage.

17:06.784 --> 17:11.554
We already have quite a few of these,
so we're willing to give one to you.

17:12.694 --> 17:13.754
Here.

17:15.264 --> 17:17.784
R-Really? Are you really?

17:22.904 --> 17:24.374
You're really going to let us have it?

17:24.904 --> 17:27.934
You're still going to ask that,
after coming this far?

17:32.914 --> 17:36.354
This means we can go to the next level?

17:39.084 --> 17:40.484
That's right.

17:40.784 --> 17:43.124
Provided that was the real stone...

17:43.524 --> 17:44.614
...you fool.

17:46.664 --> 17:47.894
Wrong!

17:50.264 --> 17:52.294
You fell for it! You fell for it!

17:52.564 --> 17:56.694
You really are a fool,
to believe such an obvious lie!

17:59.704 --> 18:00.934
Daisuke!

18:07.884 --> 18:09.284
Daisuke!

18:13.754 --> 18:14.924
I see.

18:14.924 --> 18:16.914
That was a lot of fun.

18:17.094 --> 18:19.614
What a foolish person that was.

18:20.524 --> 18:21.864
You monsters.

18:22.194 --> 18:24.184
I'll never forgive you for that!

18:24.734 --> 18:26.364
Won't forgive us?

18:26.804 --> 18:28.634
My, my.

18:28.634 --> 18:32.094
Yes, it seems that they still
don't understand our power.

18:32.504 --> 18:34.204
It's you guys who don't understand!

18:34.544 --> 18:35.574
Well, well.

18:35.574 --> 18:37.244
That's quite an allegation.

18:37.244 --> 18:38.544
In that case...

18:38.544 --> 18:42.104
...how about coming at me
with everything you've got?

18:42.814 --> 18:45.344
I will smash you to pieces
until there's nothing left.

18:45.954 --> 18:49.484
Just like that piece of trash
we just finished.

18:52.494 --> 18:53.894
Trash?

18:54.164 --> 18:56.154
How dare they call Daisuke trash?

19:05.574 --> 19:07.874
How dare they call Daisuke?

19:16.154 --> 19:17.744
Don't you insult him!

19:22.494 --> 19:23.584
Daisuke is...

19:24.994 --> 19:26.114
Daisuke is...

19:26.624 --> 19:28.994
Daisuke is not trash!

19:35.674 --> 19:38.864
His power is much greater
than what we saw at the harbor yesterday.

19:39.204 --> 19:41.834
Who is that man, anyway?

20:02.464 --> 20:03.564
Miss S-Sue...

20:03.564 --> 20:04.754
M-Master L-Lin...

20:09.074 --> 20:10.574
Th-This is incredible!

20:10.574 --> 20:11.604
Truly incredible!

20:11.604 --> 20:16.214
How could such incredible power come
from such a beautiful, slender dragon?!

20:16.214 --> 20:18.684
Wh-What's going on here?

20:18.684 --> 20:21.304
Senkohcoola's body has changed.

20:27.554 --> 20:29.524
I-It's incredible.

20:32.564 --> 20:34.184
It's frightening.

20:34.694 --> 20:36.064
Maiko?

20:36.864 --> 20:38.404
Reiji's...

20:38.404 --> 20:40.064
Reiji's completely snapped...

20:41.534 --> 20:43.304
It's frightening.

20:45.244 --> 20:47.244
No!

20:47.244 --> 20:49.214
Reiji Ohzora.

20:49.214 --> 20:53.014
You must not draw out
the power of Senkohcoola with anger!

20:54.044 --> 20:56.444
The power of anger
will not lead to any good.

20:57.414 --> 21:00.944
It is not the kind of power
fit for the guardian spirit, Senkohcoola!

21:13.704 --> 21:19.434
Is this young man still too immature
to handle Senkohcoola?

21:29.884 --> 21:31.514
I'll finish you off!

21:57.014 --> 21:59.744
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.744 --> 22:02.514
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.514 --> 22:06.454
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.924 --> 22:10.694
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.694 --> 22:12.854
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.324 --> 22:17.424
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.864 --> 22:21.534
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.534 --> 22:24.274
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.274 --> 22:28.234
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.574 --> 22:32.084
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.084 --> 22:35.084
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.084 --> 22:39.954
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.624 --> 22:43.354
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.354 --> 22:46.124
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.124 --> 22:50.754
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.504 --> 22:54.264
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.264 --> 22:56.934
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.934 --> 23:01.564
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.244 --> 23:06.734
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.684 --> 23:13.344
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

